      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "© 2011 Wiley Periodicals, Inc.",
        "AbstractText": "We present a case of L-1 type solitary (left) coronary artery that was detected with coronary computed tomography angiography and confirmed by invasive coronary angiography in a female patient with atypical chest pain. Solitary coronary artery anomalies are rare. The L-1 subtype is thought to be a benign type."
